.²1 To seize, take, take or catch hold of, lay hold of, catch, grasp; {#tayorjagrahatuH#}
 {#pAdAn rAjA rAjYI ca mAgaDI#} <ls>R. 1. 57</ls>; {#AlAne gfhyate hastI vAjI valgAsu#}
 {#gfhyate#} <ls>Mk. 1. 50</ls>; {#taM kaRWe jagrAha#} <ls>K. 363</ls>. {#pARiM gfhItvA, caraRaM gfhItvA#} <ab>&c.</ab>
.²2 To receive, take, accept, exact; {#prajAnAmeva BUtyarTaM sa tAByo balimagrahIt#}
 <ls>R. 1. 18</ls>; <ls>Ms. 7. 124</ls>, <ls n="Ms.">9. 162</ls>.
.²3 To apprehend, capture, take prisoner. {#bandigrAhaM gfhItvA#} <ls>V. 1</ls>;
 {#yAMstatra corAn gfhRIyAt#} <ls>Ms. 8. 34</ls>.
.²4 To arrest, stop, catch; {#aByAsena tu kOnteya vErAgyeRa ca gfhyate#} <ls>Bg. 6. 35</ls>.
.²5 To captivate, attract; {#mahArAjagfhItahfdayayA mayA#} <ls>V. 4</ls>; {#hfdaye#}
 {#gfhyate nArI#} <ls>Mk. 1. 50</ls>; {#mADuryamIzwe hariRAn grahItum#} <ls>R. 18. 13</ls>.
.²6 To win over, persuade, induce to oneʼs side; {#lubDamarTena gfhRIyAt#}
 <ls>Chāṇ. 33</ls>; <ls>Pt. 1. 69</ls>, <ls n="Pt. 1.">184</ls>.
.²7 (Hence) To please, gratify, satisfy, propitiate; {#grahItumAryAn paricaryayA#}
 {#muhurmahAnuBAvA hi nitAntamarTinaH#} <ls>Śi. 1. 17</ls>, <ls n="Śi. 1.">33</ls>.
.²8 To affect; seize or possess (as a demon, spirit <ab>&c.</ab>); as in {#piSAcagfhIta#},
 {#vetAlagfhIta#}.
.²9 To assume, take; {#dyutimagrahId grahagaRaH#} <ls>Śi. 9. 23</ls>; <ls>Bk. 19. 29</ls>.
.²10 To learn, know, recognize, understand; {#yuvatIjanErjagrahe munipraBAvaH#}
 <ls>Ki. 10. 8</ls>; <ls>Pt. 1. 43</ls>.
.²11 To regard, consider,

 believe, take for; {#mayApi mftpiRqabudDinA taTEva gfhItam#} <ls>Ś. 6</ls>; {#parihAsavijalpitaM#}
 {#saKe paramArTena na gfhyatAM vacaH#} <ls>Ś. 2. 19</ls>; {#evaM jano gfhRAti#} <ls>M. 1</ls>; <ls>Mu. 3</ls>.
.²12 To catch or perceive (as by an organ of sense); {#jyAninAdamaTa gfhRatI#}
 {#tayoH#} <ls>R. 11. 15</ls>.
.²13 To master, grasp, comprehend; {#nyastAkzarAmakzaraBUmikAyAM kArtsnyena#}
 {#gfhRAti lipiM na yAvat#} <ls>R. 18. 46</ls>.
.²14 To guess, conjecture, infer; {#netravaktravikArESca gfhyate'ntargataM#}
 {#manaH#} <ls>Ms. 8. 26</ls>.
.²15 To utter, mention (as a name); {#yadi mayAnyasya nAmApi na gfhitam#}
 <ls>K. 305</ls>; {#na tu nAmApi gfhRIyAt patyO prete parasya tu#} <ls>Ms. 5. 157</ls>.
.²16 To buy, purchase; {#kriyatA mUlyenEtatpustakaM gfhItam#} <ls>Pt. 2</ls>; <ls>Y. 2. 169</ls>;
 <ls>Ms. 8. 201</ls>.
