 {#prARAn bahUnAmagrahId dvizAm#} <ls>Bk. 9. 9</ls>, <ls n="Bk.">15. 63</ls>.
.²18 To wear, put on (as clothes <ab>&c.</ab>); {#vAsAMsi jIrRAni yaTA vihAya navAni#}
 {#gfhRAti naro'parARi#} <ls>Bg. 2. 22</ls>.
.²19 To conceive.
.²20 To observe (as a fast).
.²21 To eclipse.
.²22 To undertake, undergo, begin.
.²23 To take up, draw (water.); {#apasPuraM gfBAyata somamindrAya pAtave#} <ls>Rv. 8. 69. 10</ls>.
.²24 To stop, intercept.
.²25 To withdraw, draw back; {#yaTArRanABiH sfjate gfhRate#} <ls>Muṇḍ. 1. 7</ls>.
